WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.745
The finitistic dimension conjecture fails.

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:05.906
Bass expected finite resolutions to have bounded

3
00:00:05.906 --> 00:00:08.139
length; here they grow without bound.

4
00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:11.582
One operation, repeated, dies after two m

5
00:00:11.582 --> 00:00:13.864
rounds but not two m minus two.

6
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:17.251
Claimed: the finitistic dimension is infinite.

7
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.427
Main theorem Lean-checked.
